<speak>The weather is exactly why we now have a backup idea. Last time we planned a walk, the sky opened just as we were about to leave. Normally everyone would retreat to a different room, but we found somewhere indoors to visit instead. It was quite nice. I'm not trying to fill every spare hour; I just want us to have options that don't involve everyone saying, 'Never mind, another day.' Sometimes another day never gets chosen, and suddenly a whole month has gone by.</speak>